      "text": "Frontend route groups\nPublic: /, /auth/login, /auth/signup, /auth/forgot-password, /auth/reset-password, /auth/callback, /faq, /legal/*\nProtected: /dashboard, /profile, /projects, /projects/create, /projects/[id], /projects/[id]/edit, /learning, /settings, /chat, /chat/[id], /qna, /qna/new, /qna/[id]\nNext API: auth, profile, courses, chat, qna",
