      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Verified caveats shown in code\n/api/roadmaps and /api/dev-tools are called by hooks but no route files exist, so local fallback is active.\nProfile completion route is sequential, not transactional; code comment recommends a Postgres RPC for true atomicity.\nFrontend sends user_id/session_id to AIChat body, but FastAPI ignores trust in body and uses verified JWT identity.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Verified caveats shown in code\n/api/roadmaps and /api/dev-tools are called by hooks but no route files exist, so local fallback is active.\nProfile completion route is sequential, not transactional; code comment recommends a Postgres RPC for true atomicity.\nFrontend sends user_id/session_id to AIChat body, but FastAPI ignores trust in body and uses verified JWT identity.",
